{
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heeey, Chiyari!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yessss?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why're you bothering me at this hour?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"At this hour?\" What time do you think it is?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, what time is it?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How am I supposed to tell from down here?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, right."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What matters is, now is our big moment!",
                "Get your head in the game!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You mean, it's time for the decisive battle?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, something like that.",
                "My enemies might come to mess with you."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So be ready."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Pwaaaah, I'm sleepy..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How did that kinda friendship come to be?",
                "I want to know..."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So that monkey is Yachie's foothold."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you perhaps...",
                "The head of the Gouyoku Alliance, Yuuma Toutetsu?!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you've come, then that means...",
                "It's finally begun?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Keh heh heh, you're an energetic youth.",
                "As expected, <b$freshly-awakened> youkai are something else."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The decisive battle begins!",
                "To start, I'll take you out in style!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, your name's Biten?",
                "How'd Yachie sink her hooks into you?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That is to say, I owe her my life."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The biggest psychopath in the animal realm",
                "saved your life, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When I was on the cusp of falling to Hell,",
                "Lady Yachie extended a helping hand."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh....",
                "But she looked so strong..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heeeeeey, Yachie!",
                "Are you in?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who is it?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm hm hm, finally."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? If it isn't Yuuma.",
                "What are you doing, taking center stage?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're calling the Riverbed of Limbo center stage?",
                "You don't even have anywhere to stand on."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? It was that or the Former Hell of Blood Pools..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, sorry 'bout that.",
                "The Riverbed of Limbo will make a fine stage."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, the decisive battle got sparked off."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By yours truly."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Be sure to come at me with your best!",
                "Then surpass even your best!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I guess that was okay.",
                "By Kiketsu Family standards."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tsk!",
                "I can't fight at my best when it's fair and square!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh, right you are.",
                "Only wimps pride themselves on fighting fair."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sorry you couldn't show off your strengths.",
                "I really mean that."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Bah, what a disappointment."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She never had a good eye for talent, but..."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So that old yamainu is Saki's foothold."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, those distinctive looks could only be..."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The head of the Gouyoku Alliance, Yuuma Toutetsu?!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That means you're my enemy.",
                "Great!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was told to crush all our enemies, without exception."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's the Keiga Family for you.",
                "They taught you good."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In this world, it's survival of the fittest!",
                "If you're weak, then you should just die!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "S-So strong...!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, how'd you become one of Saki's followers?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, it was the power Lady Saki held that saved me",
                "from falling into Hell."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you could say I owe her my life."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell... You owe her your life...",
                "Now where have I heard that before."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's like deja vu."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Gouyoku Alliance is pathetic!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you thinking, Saki?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess I'm not one to talk,",
                "but you've been befriending a pretty shady youkai."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What I think?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't have any problems."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Apart from the fact that you're here, Yuuma.",
                "That's a pretty big problem."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Were you trying to get into a fight with me,",
                "deliberately going after my foothold like that?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, so the decisive battle's come to a head!",
                "Once I take you out, it'll end things for now!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Very well! I'll show you the power and speed",
                "of the top beast!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're as tough as ever, Yuuma."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's wrong?",
                "Got something on your mind?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, I've already resolved myself."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Guess I should head over to her."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've lost your edge!",
                "Train harder!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those fights back there made up my mind."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Something's felt off about this from the start,",
                "but those two aren't to blame."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And Chiyari's in on it too, without a doubt."
            ]
        },
        "140_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Took you long enough to notice!"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If that's the case, it has to come from whoever's behind",
                "Biten and Enoko."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "These people all have something in common: Hell!",
                "And your instigation! Zanmu Nippaku!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Does one need this level of instinct to make it",
                "as a top dog of the Animal Realm?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought that teleportation trap of Chiyari's ",
                "was suspicious from the moment I found it."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was a sign someone was manipulating",
                "the incident behind the scenes."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "At first I thought Yachie, or maybe Okina,",
                "was that someone."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you scheming?",
                "To conquer the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm-hmm."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nowadays, I want nothing from the surface.",
                "Unlike you starveling beasts."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It is the future that I want.",
                "I've manipulated everything to create that future."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But no, it was you, Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have no choice but to live in the palm of my hand!",
                "Understand, you wretched beast!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can't change anything",
                "if you're that weak!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is frustrating..."
            ]
        }
    }
}